step	1	2	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080>In <col=800000>Varrock</col> square I heard about a delegation arriving from <col=800000>Varlamore</col>. One of the guards hurried off with a large bag. I should follow him without being seen and without losing him.</col>
step	2	8	While tailing the guard
line	<str>In Varrock square I heard about a delegation arriving from Varlamore. One of the guards hurried off with a large bag.</str>
line	<col=000080>I set off after the guard, keeping out of sight. I need to see where he takes the bag.</col>
step	3	10	After overhearing the meeting
line	<str>In Varrock square I heard about a delegation arriving from Varlamore. One of the guards hurried off with a large bag.</str>
line	<str>I set off after the guard, keeping out of sight.</str>
line	<col=000080>I tailed the guard to south-east <col=800000>Varrock</col> and overheard him meeting with a group of bandits. I should report to <col=800000>Sergeant Tobyn</col> in <col=800000>Varrock</col> square.</col>
step	4	12	After reporting to Tobyn
line	<str>In Varrock square I heard about a delegation arriving from Varlamore. One of the guards hurried off with a large bag.</str>
line	<str>I set off after the guard, keeping out of sight.</str>
line	<str>I tailed the guard to south-east Varrock and overheard him meeting with a group of bandits.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Sergeant Tobyn</col> believes some of the guards in the square are bandits in disguise. I should mark the four impostors for him.</col>
step	5	16	After marking the bandits
line	<str>In Varrock square I heard about a delegation arriving from Varlamore. One of the guards hurried off with a large bag.</str>
line	<str>I set off after the guard, keeping out of sight.</str>
line	<str>I tailed the guard to south-east Varrock and overheard him meeting with a group of bandits.</str>
line	<str>Sergeant Tobyn believes some of the guards in the square are bandits in disguise.</str>
line	<col=000080>I picked out the four bandits, and <col=800000>Sergeant Tobyn</col> took me to a cell on the palace roof, where <col=800000>Prince Itzla</col> began questioning the captured bandit. I should watch the interrogation.</col>
step	6	22	After the interrogation
line	<str>In Varrock square I heard about a delegation arriving from Varlamore. One of the guards hurried off with a large bag.</str>
line	<str>I set off after the guard, keeping out of sight.</str>
line	<str>I tailed the guard to south-east Varrock and overheard him meeting with a group of bandits.</str>
line	<str>Sergeant Tobyn believes some of the guards in the square are bandits in disguise.</str>
line	<str>I picked out the four bandits, and Sergeant Tobyn took me to a cell on the palace roof, where Prince Itzla began questioning the captured bandit.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Prince Itzla</col> finished questioning the bandit and left. I should talk to <col=800000>Sergeant Tobyn</col>.</col>
